Skills first on the tools page
==============================

The page is called "Tools & skills" and it opened with a wall of connection cards. The two skill
libraries — what upstream ships and the Hermes library on this machine — sat below them, under the
fold, which is the wrong way round: the instructions are what a person comes here to read, and the
connections are plumbing that is set up once.

Order now: search, both libraries (QuixiDesk, then Hermes), a rule, then Connections with its cards.

Nothing about the libraries themselves changed — same two, same searches; they simply start where the
page starts.

